  "description": "Subject\u202f001 (RegName\u202f=\u202fSubject001) was processed through the HCP ICAFIX functional pipeline using the standard FIX classifier **HCP_hp2000**. The pipeline was configured with a high\u2011pass filter of **2000\u202fHz** and was set **not to preserve any intermediate results on error** (PreserveOnError\u202f=\u202ffalse).\n\nAll required inputs were supplied as zip archives: the structural image (StructZip) and the ten functional runs (FuncZip, FuncZip2, FuncZip3, FuncZip4, FuncZip5, FuncZip6, FuncZip7, FuncZip8, FuncZip9, and FuncZip10) each have the type \u201czip\u201d. No custom classifier was provided (CustomClassifier is empty).",
